      <p>This Privacy Policy describes how ${c(Zb)} (\u201CIntrilex,\u201D \u201Cwe,\u201D \u201Cus\u201D) handles personal information in connection with the Intrilex tactical card game and related services (the \u201CService\u201D). By accessing or using Intrilex, you acknowledge this Privacy Policy.</p>
